{
  "id": "alerts",
  "summary": "Alerts Center: what the system detected and the team needs to work on.",
  "purpose": "Brings together the alerts created by the rules (unconfirmed appointments, pending payments, follow-ups, birthdays…) grouped by category and priority, so you can work them: notify by WhatsApp or email, log the call, snooze, ignore, add a note or mark them as resolved, one at a time or several at once.",
  "tips": [
    "Alerts are created by the rules in System → Alert Rules.",
    "Assigning an alert to someone removes it from the rest of the team's view.",
    "Each alert's color strip is its priority: red critical, orange high, yellow medium.",
    "Every action (call, message, note) is kept in the alert's history.",
    "Snoozing removes it from the inbox until a date; ignoring dismisses it with a reason."
  ],
